{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0195",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "「不，我沒資格。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "No, I do not have the right.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "只能死了娶你的心。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I could only marry your heart after I die.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你看看我的臉，是不是很紅？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Look at my face. Is it not very red?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "真的喝酒了。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I really have been drinking.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "「那是因為夕陽照射的關係吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That must be because the setting sun is shining on you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "騙人家也沒用呀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It is no use trying to fool me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "昨天都一言為定了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "We settled it yesterday, after all.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "你不可能又喝了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There is no way you drank again.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "我們拉過鉤的。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "We even made a pinky promise.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "什麼喝酒呀，騙人、騙人、騙人！」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Drinking, you say? Liar, liar, liar!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "良子坐在昏暗的店內微笑著，那白皙的臉蛋，啊，還有她對汙穢一概不知的「童貞」，是多麼的尊貴。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yoshiko sat smiling in the dim shop; that pale face, ah, and her innocence that knew nothing of impurity, how precious it was.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "時至今日，我還沒跟比我小的處女上過床。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even now, I had never slept with a virgin younger than myself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "那就跟她結婚吧，無論今後會因此遭遇多大悲傷也無妨，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Then I would marry her; no matter how much sorrow might come from it afterward, that would be fine.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00195",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "一輩子得有那麼一次放縱的狂歡才是。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At least once in a lifetime, one ought to have such a reckless revelry.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
